# ============================================================================
# Hugo Site .gitignore
# ============================================================================

# ============================================================================
# Hugo Build Artifacts
# ============================================================================

# Generated site output.
# `public/` alone was not enough: every phase builds to its own scratch
# destination (`hugo --destination public_p8`) so it can be diffed against the
# previous one, and those escaped the pattern. Commit efebb36 added 1,464
# generated files from `public_p8/` to the repository as a result. Match any
# `public*` directory at the root instead.
public/
/public_*/

# Hugo resources (processed assets).
# Anchored to the repository root: an unanchored `resources/` also matched
# `layouts/resources/`, which silently excluded the Phase 5 Resources section
# template from the repository.
/resources/

# Hugo build lock
.hugo_build.lock

# Hugo stats
hugo_stats.json

# Auto-generated JS config
**/assets/jsconfig.json

# ============================================================================
# Node.js & Package Managers
# ============================================================================

# Dependencies
node_modules/

# ============================================================================
# Environment & Configuration
# ============================================================================

# Environment variables
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local

# ============================================================================
# Development Tools
# ============================================================================

# IDE & Editors
.vscode/
.idea/

# ============================================================================
# Generated Content
# ============================================================================

# Pagefind search index
pagefind/
static/pagefind/

# ============================================================================
# Operating System
# ============================================================================

# macOS
.DS_Store
.DS_Store?
._*

# Windows
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini

# Linux
*~

# ============================================================================
# Logs & Temporary Files
# ============================================================================

*.log
npm-debug.log*

# ============================================================================
# Redesign Artifacts
# ============================================================================

# Rendered QA screenshots (~43 MB of JPEGs). Kept on disk for review but not
# committed, to avoid permanently adding binaries to history. Every finding's
# underlying measurements are in docs/redesign/evidence/*.json, and the
# capture drivers there regenerate the images on demand:
#   hugo server --disableFastRender --port 1315
#   node docs/redesign/evidence/phase2a-qa-driver.mjs
docs/redesign/screenshots/**/*.png
docs/redesign/screenshots/**/*.jpg
docs/redesign/screenshots/**/*.jpeg
# ...but keep the written review notes that live alongside them.
!docs/redesign/screenshots/**/*.md

# ============================================================================
# Sync / backup leftovers (site audit 2026-10-04, H7)
# ============================================================================

# File-sync conflict copies named after the machine that made them. Two of
# these (content/projects/_index-SAJID-PC.md, ...) were published as pages.
*-SAJID-PC.*
*-Sajid-Asus-Laptop.*
# Disabled copies of templates/pages kept by renaming the extension.
*.md1
*.html1
# Office lock/temp files and hand-made backups of the roster workbook.
~$*
*.tmp
*-BAK.xlsx

# Microsoft Edge WebDriver (18.5 MB). No script in the repository uses it; it
# is a per-machine download matching the installed Edge version.
cv/msedgedriver.exe
